<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Feb 25.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Feb 25.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Highest and lowest price earnings ratios for Australian companies included in the 320-company All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday. P/E based on rolling 12 months earnings.</p>
<p>Highest 10</p>
<p>Rank Name		     P/E    Close</p>
<p> 1   Portman Min	   406.35    2.56</p>
<p> 2   Kidston Gold	  291.67    1.40</p>
<p> 3   Mt Edon Gold	  240.66    2.19</p>
<p> 4   Niugini Min	   235.97    3.28</p>
<p> 5   Mayne Nickless	168.21    7.62</p>
<p> 6   St.Barbara Mine     128.17    0.91</p>
<p> 7   Adel Bton Cement    123.19    1.70</p>
<p> 8   Colonial Coml	 122.95    2.25</p>
